(load "carp-math.carp")

(Project.config "title" "carp-math")
(Project.config "docs-directory" "./docs/")
(Project.config "docs-logo" "")
(Project.config "docs-url" "https://github.com/carpentry-org/carp-math")
(Project.config "docs-styling" "../style.css")
(Project.config "docs-prelude" "A math suite for Carp: colour spaces, complex
numbers, matrices, quaternions and transforms, noise, SIMD, and an FFT with the
windowing and convolution that go with it.

Load the whole suite, or any single module on its own:
```
(load \"git@github.com:carpentry-org/carp-math@master\")
; or, for just one:
(load \"git@github.com:carpentry-org/carp-math@master\" \"matrix.carp\")
```

### Colour
- [`Color`](./Color.html) — conversion between [`RGB`](./RGB.html),
  [`RGBA`](./RGBA.html), [`HSL`](./HSL.html), [`HSV`](./HSV.html) and
  [`CMYK`](./CMYK.html)

### Linear algebra
- [`Mat`](./Mat.html) — dense [`Matrix`](./Matrix.html) arithmetic
- [`Quaternion`](./Quaternion.html) — rotations
- [`TransformMat4`](./TransformMat4.html) — 4x4 matrices, column-major
- [`Transform`](./Transform.html) — translation, rotation and scale together

### Signal
- [`Complex`](./Complex.html) — complex arithmetic
- [`FFT`](./FFT.html) — fast Fourier transform
- [`Window`](./Window.html) — window functions
- [`Spectrum`](./Spectrum.html) — spectral analysis
- [`Convolution`](./Convolution.html) — FFT-based convolution

### Noise
- [`Noise`](./Noise.html) — perlin and simplex noise, with
  [`FBMConfig`](./FBMConfig.html) for fractal brownian motion

### SIMD
- [`Simd`](./Simd.html), [`SimdFloat`](./SimdFloat.html),
  [`SimdInt`](./SimdInt.html) — vectorized primitives
- [`SimdArray`](./SimdArray.html) — vectorized array operations

### A note on the file name
The colour module lives in `colors.carp`, not `color.carp`. Carp searches the
working directory before the directory of the file doing the loading, and
carp's own `Test.carp` starts with `(load \"Color.carp\")`. On a
case-insensitive filesystem a `color.carp` in the project root answers that
load instead of core's, and every test in the project fails to find
`IO.colorize`.")

(save-docs Color
           RGB
           RGBA
           HSL
           HSV
           CMYK
           Complex
           Convolution
           FFT
           Mat
           Matrix
           Noise
           NoiseState
           FBMConfig
           Simd
           SimdFloat
           SimdInt
           SimdArray
           Spectrum
           Quaternion
           TransformMat4
           Transform
           Window)
; Carp's save-docs hardcodes the index filename as <title>_index.html.
; Rename to docs/index.html.
(defn main [] (System.system "mv ./docs/carp-math_index.html ./docs/index.html"))
